	<section_number>55.1-114</section_number>
	<catch_line>When contingent remainder not to fail</catch_line>
	<text>
		A contingent remainder shall not fail for want of a particular estate to support it.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5153; Code 1950, § 55-15; 2019, c. 712.</history>
